   "note": "Article runs pp. 26–30 (PDF 46–50), vv. 13–23. Denis's closing afterthought on the star is tagged v. 2, so the article header reads 'vv. 2–23'. Two quotations Denis gives in non-Vulgate form are translated without markers, with a translator's note: Is 11:1 'Nazaræus de radice ejus' (Hebrew, via Jerome) and Jerome's Septuagint reading of Num 23:22 ('Deus ex Ægypto vocavit eum; gloria ejus ut unicornis'). Matt 2:22: the Douay-Rheims file misspells 'Archclaus', so the name is kept outside the quotation marker."
